{
  "_implementation_notes": [
    "MOON ISLANDS — Maps 819, 821, 822, 823, 824, 835.",
    "Tone: Mysterious, lunar, dreamlike. The boundary between sleep",
    "and waking is thin here. Darkrai speaks in cold certainty,",
    "Cresselia in warm urgency. The islands exist between worlds.",
    "",
    "The Darkrai/Cresselia quest is a COMPLEX MECHANICAL SYSTEM with",
    "many interlocking switches (1027, 1029, 1030) and conditions.",
    "ALL choice prompts, feather placement mechanics, item transfers,",
    "and switch-triggered state changes are MECHANICAL — preserved.",
    "Only the flavor/personality of Darkrai and Cresselia dialogue",
    "is rewritten, keeping all \\C[2] (Darkrai) and \\C[9] (Cresselia)",
    "color codes intact.",
    "",
    "Maps 819/821/835 are variants of the same island layouts with",
    "similar events. Map 819 is Halfmoon Island (Darkrai collection",
    "point). Maps 821/835 are Newmoon Island variants. Map 823 is",
    "Fullmoon Island.",
    "",
    "Map 822 (Moonlit Forest): EV067 atmospheric sign — rewritten.",
    "",
    "Map 824 (Moonlit Forest): Contains the Mareep/Flaaffy counting",
    "puzzle (EV036, EV032) — MECHANICAL puzzle logic preserved,",
    "sleepy NPC flavor rewritten. 'Bahhh!' cries are MECHANICAL",
    "counting triggers — preserved. 'Little fish' warning signs are",
    "MECHANICAL gameplay hints — preserved. EV041 atmospheric sign",
    "rewritten. EV042 Darkrai omen sign rewritten.",
    "",
    "Line length limit: ~42 characters per line for RPG Maker XP."
  ],
